WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,760
Inspect the goods first, then write a letter

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:02,760
Don't mess with the rules

3
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,740
Four of them went to be checked.

4
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:05,900
Complete hands and feet

5
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:06,940
Joint movement is normal

6
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,940
No rotten clothes, thank you

7
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,180
Thank you, Taoist Xiaozhuang

8
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,540
My father can return safely

9
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:13,780
It's all yours. I'll sign for it immediately and wait.

10
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:16,460
Although the core components are all fine,

11
00:00:17,030 --> 00:00:18,150
This outer packaging

12
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:19,550
in transit

13
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:21,470
Some irresistible wear and tear occurred

14
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:22,430
But don't worry

15
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:24,430
In an attitude of absolute responsibility to customers

16
00:00:24,430 --> 00:00:26,070
I have already contacted the relevant departments to determine the responsibility.

17
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:28,150
On the way to escort the homeless people back home

18
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:30,590
For cooperating with the national special security department in the performance of official duties

19
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:31,590
Resulting in the deceased's relics

20
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:33,510
