21
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:35,150
This loss number is fully certified by our bureau

22
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:37,190
No problem, absolutely no problem, Mr. Xiaozhuang

23
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:38,230
This road has high mountains and long rivers

24
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:40,630
Also, it’s too hard for you to deal with the state departments.

25
00:00:40,630 --> 00:00:43,150
